          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "In the upper reaches of the HimalayanIn the upper reaches of the Himalayan region, a traditional room heater locallyregion, a traditional room heater locally known as bukhari is used to keep rooms is used to keep rooms warm during winters. It consists of an ironwarm during winters. It consists of an iron stove in which wood or charcoal is burnt.stove in which wood or charcoal is burnt. A long pipe attached to the upper part ofA long pipe attached to the upper part of the heater serves as a chimney, ventingthe heater serves as a chimney, venting out the smoke. Additionally, the bukharibukhari can be used for cooking, as its flat topcan be used for cooking, as its flat top provides a platform for placing utensils.provides a platform for placing utensils. All the three processes of heat transferAll the three processes of heat transfer are involved when this device is used forare involved when this device is used for cooking and warming up the room."
            }
          ]
        },
